      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 17,
      "end_line": 17,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "start_line": 18,
      "end_line": 18,
      "raw": "## 사용 예시\n",
      "level": 2,
      "title": "사용 예시"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000010",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 19,
      "end_line": 19,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000011",
      "kind": "fenced_code",
      "start_line": 20,
      "end_line": 31,
      "raw": "```cpp\n#include <iiHtmlBlock>\n\niiHtmlBlock::DeleteBlock deleter;\n\nif (deleter.Parse(\"<XML><section><p>One</p><p>Two</p></section></XML>\")) {\n    if (deleter.Delete(1)) {\n        // deleter.GetHTMLText() == \"<XML><section><p>Two</p></section></XML>\"\n        // deleter.GetDeletedBlocks()[0].raw == \"<p>One</p>\"\n    }\n}\n```\n",
      "language": "cpp",
      "code": "#include <iiHtmlBlock>\n\niiHtmlBlock::DeleteBlock deleter;\n\nif (deleter.Parse(\"<XML><section><p>One</p><p>Two</p></section></XML>\")) {\n    if (deleter.Delete(1)) {\n        // deleter.GetHTMLText() == \"<XML><section><p>Two</p></section></XML>\"\n        // deleter.GetDeletedBlocks()[0].raw == \"<p>One</p>\"\n    }\n}\n",
      "closed": true
    },
    {
      "id": "b000012",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 32,
      "end_line": 32,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 33,
      "end_line": 35,
      "raw": "`ParseHtml(const QString&)` 슬롯은 성공 시 `Parsed(block_count)`, 실패 시\n`DeleteFailed(reason)` 시그널을 내보낸다. `DeleteBlockAt(int)` 슬롯은 성공 시\n`Deleted(deleted_count, html)`, 실패 시 `DeleteFailed(reason)` 시그널을 내보낸다.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000014",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 36,
      "end_line": 36,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
